<title>UK: Algeria's Skikda port may reopen fully Friday.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Skikda port may reopen fully Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port remains closed to most maritime traffic because of bad weather but should be open again by midday Friday, a port official said.</p>
<p>The port would probably be fully open again &quot;if not tomorrow morning, then tomorrow midday,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>He said one LPG cargo had managed to berth but other vessels had not yet been given clearance.</p>
<p>The port has been closed since Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
